# Text and localization

- Key `"<area>.<name>"` in BOTH `EN` and `TR` of the area module; same `{fields}`; no Turkish letters in EN; TR is a real translation.
- Read with `i18n.t(...)`; pass values as fields, never glue translated pieces.
- Protocol tokens (`SECTIONS`, `PROMPTS`, `templates/en|tr`) only grow: add a spelling, never remove one. Keep `templates/en` and `templates/tr` identical in placeholders and table shape.
- `intent.py` vocabulary only grows.
- New tests set `ORKESTRA_LANG` explicitly (`en` and `tr`); the suite default is `tr`.
- Narrow gate: `cd plugins/orkestra/tests && python3 -m unittest test_i18n test_docs_drift -q`.
